      "why": "flow5 emits 26 keys: the six longitudinal polar channels, the twelve StabDerivatives, CLa/Cma, a CDvis/CDind split and XNP.  The four absent slots are the three q-derivatives the runner does not forward and the aileron side force its control helper does not ask for"
